{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1557773-la-in-anarchy-a-20th-anniversary-pbp-venue-set-in-2030s-los-angles","id":1557773,"title":"LA in Anarchy | A 20th Anniversary PBP Venue set in 2030s Los Angles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-01-19T23:14:48-08:00","id":1557773,"title":"LA in Anarchy | A 20th Anniversary PBP Venue set in 2030s Los Angles","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">LAiA is a Play-by-Post \u201cFangs of Our Lives\u201d sandbox venue using Vampire: the Masquerade 20th Anniversary Edition rules, and we\u2019re looking for new players to join us for our 8th consecutive year of play!</span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\">What We Offer</span></b></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Broad Character Creation.</span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Anyone freshly joining can submit characters for approval from any of the 13 clans, with characters up to 800 years old, and up to 150 starting XP. Active players will quickly be able to dip their toes into mortal sorcerers, dhampir, various rare bloodlines, and even transfer accrued XP for characters older than 800.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Generous Advancement.</span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Free dots! Design your own custom discipline powers! Combination disciplines! Drop your character as low as 6th Generation! (If Caine\u2019s feeling generous\u2026)</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Overhauled Morality.</b> </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">We\u2019ve overhauled the Hierarchy of Sins to provide a more granular approach to morality, opting for a sliding difficulty scale, and allowing characters to take Principles that align with their personal beliefs.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Revised Disciplines.</span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Ever disillusioned by Animalism past the first dot, disappointed Presence was so easy to throw off, or thought Thanatosis was just plain bad? No longer! Many Disciplines were tweaked (or outright rewritten, such as poor Thanatosis) to bring them up to parity with the rest.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Optional Seasonal Events.</span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Join us in time for our 2026 Anniversarchy in July to answer scene prompts for insane rewards, or participate in our Storyteller-ran 2026 Halloween event! Feeling festive? Come check out our 6th annual Christmas event, where we\u2019ve regularly given out over 40+ custom magic artifacts each year. Those who stick around until the new year will even be able to explore an entirely new setting as we host our next Alternative Universe event in Q1 of 2027.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Crosssplat Story Potential.</b> Want to explore a Kindred with a Garou Ally? Or a Hedge Sorcerer with an Awakened mentor? We make space for both and more!</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Custom Bot Function.</b> Set up character profiles, earn weekly XP, roll dice, set up scenes, open lootboxes, and more with our custom bot Caine! </span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Prose-Oriented Structure.</span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Scenes are organized into their own text channels, giving you and your partner (or group!) a space to write at your leisure, and allowing for more prose-style posting than a traditional chatroom/MUSH experience.</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Antagonist System.</span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Active players are eligible to run their own Storyteller-aided plots in the form of our antagonist system\u2014unleash a Sabbat pack, mad Black Spiral Dancer, or something even stranger on the cast for them to thwart (or make a mess of the city trying).</span></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Zero-Tolerance AI Policy.</span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\">Using AI as a writing aid in any capacity is strictly not allowed. You\u2019ll write with other human beings!</span></span></span></li> </ul><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">What to know more? Check us out at </span><a href=\"https://lainanarchy.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><u>https://lainanarchy.com/</u></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\">, join the server with </span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/lainanarchy\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><u>https://discord.gg/lainanarchy</u></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\">, or ask questions below! We\u2019d love to see if we\u2019re a good fit.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24340-stone","name":"Stone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","